---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Contact the desk — Rent Free News">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-10">
    <div class="kicker text-brand-600">Newsroom</div>
    <h1 class="font-display font-black text-[36px] tracking-[-0.02em] mt-1">Contact the desk</h1>
    <div class="prose dark:prose-invert font-serif mt-4">
      <p>Tips, corrections, and creator submissions all land in one inbox: <a href="mailto:desk@rentfreenews.com">desk@rentfreenews.com</a>.</p>
      <p>Send a claim with its link and we will check the primary source. Send a test with its VOD timestamp and we may quote you - with permission, a draft first, and a link back.</p>
      <p>Advertising goes to <a href="mailto:ads@rentfreenews.com">ads@rentfreenews.com</a>. Verdicts are never for sale; see our <a href="/advertise/">ethics page</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
